export anchor RainyNeonCityStyle:
    number: 274
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Rainy neon city
    idea: A wet night street where the file list glows like shop signs on rain soaked asphalt, pink and cyan neon tubes, soft bokeh and reflections pooling under every row.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #090c15, the page and street background
        asphalt: #111725, the details window and the style sheet
        wet: #1a2136, raised fields and the switch track
        selected: #22183a, the selected row behind a pink edge
        ink: #eef1f8, names and body text
        mist: #a6b1c8, meta, labels, column heads and placeholders
        line: #2b3652, dividers and borders
        pinkNeon: #ff6bb0, the primary button with dark ink #1d0412, the wordmark glow, Starred and the selected edge
        cyanNeon: #4fe5ec, file icons, secondary button outlines, Shared and the focus ring
        amber: #ffc95e, folder icons and Uploading
    type:
        A condensed sans stack, Avenir Next Condensed, Roboto Condensed,
        Arial Narrow, then system-ui, with font-stretch condensed. Base 15px
        at 1.45. The wordmark is 30px bold caps tracked 0.12em with a pink
        glow and a cyan Drive line under it. The folder title is 28px bold,
        file names 16px semibold, column heads and labels 12px caps tracked
        0.14em, buttons 14px bold caps.
    layout:
        A dark street header carries blurred bokeh discs in pink, cyan,
        violet and amber and fine diagonal rain lines, clipped by the
        header section. The neon wordmark sits left and the Search files
        field right. Below are three columns. A 210px sidebar lists My
        files, Shared with me, Recent, Starred and Trash in caps, the
        current item lit by a pink left tube and a fading pink wash, with
        storage below as 64.2 GB of 100 GB used, a thin cyan to pink tube
        and 35.8 GB free. The middle column has the breadcrumb, the title
        Website redesign, then Upload, New folder and a List or Grid switch
        with List underlined in cyan. The list is a header row and eight
        rows of icon, name over kind, size, date and person, and status.
        Each row fades into a centred reflection line. The selected
        brand-guide-v3.pdf row has a violet fill, a pink left edge and a
        pink to cyan line. hero-motion.mp4 shows an amber progress tube. A
        300px details window on the right glows pink and holds the preview,
        name, Starred, owner, size, version, shared with, modified and the
        three buttons. Below 1100px the window drops under the list. Below
        760px everything stacks, the nav becomes two columns and rows wrap
        into name, size, date and status lines.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px gutters, 24px between columns, 12px row padding, 20px window padding.
    density: Medium. Eight rows fit with room for the reflection lines.
    corners: 2px everywhere so neon reads as glass tubes and signs.
    borders: 1px dark steel lines. Rows end in a centred fading reflection line. Status chips are 1px outlines in their colour.
    shadows: Coloured glows only, pink round the details window and primary button, cyan on focus.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.6px, 22px in rows, cyan for files and amber for
        folders. Status is an outlined caps chip with a word and a star for
        Starred, two heads for Shared, an up arrow for Uploading and a
        checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline offset 3px with a soft cyan halo.
    tone: Short caps labels, such as Upload, New folder and Details.
